 ## Operating characteristics
-- **Time Complexity:** $O(N)$ where $N$ is the number of samples per ray. Supersampling adds $O(N_{ss})$ where $N_{ss}$ is the number of additional samples [S2, unofficial].
-- **Memory Complexity:** $O(N)$ for storing sample positions and points [S1, unofficial].
